@Bass_Ackwards__ @goldseek So have the rules of Bitcoin, ever so slightly, but only when overwhelming consensus was reached that those rules were better.

@getwhatugive @goldseek I didn't compare it to the internet.

AI can try, but it turns out network effects are really, really hard to break.

You should know, gold has a very old one, and many of the largest companies on earth have them as their primary product.

Bitcoin is special because of its genesis, its properties, being first of its kind, and its history as a result.

Only its properties can be replicated, but you would need all of them together to challenge it.

There are countless forks and shitcoins, but none have any appreciable value.

The market has convincingly proven that Bitcoin is in a league of it's own.

@Bass_Ackwards__ @goldseek AI cannot convince the existing pool players to switch mate.

